        {
          "id": "about",
          "type": "story",
          "variant": "about",
          "content": {
            "eyebrow": "About us",
            "title": "A kitchen built on the idea that fast food can be real food",
            "description": "Root & Grain opened its first store in 2014 with four burners, one salad bowl and a promise to pay farms fairly.",
            "body": [
              "We started because lunch in America had become a choice between fast and good. Our founders, a chef and a vegetable farmer, believed the two could be the same thing: a bowl of greens somebody grew with care, finished in a kitchen that respects it.",
              "Today we cook from scratch in every store. Grains are roasted each morning, dressings are pressed the same day they are served, and 38 family farms across three states plan their plantings around what our guests actually order."
            ],
            "media": {
              "kind": "image",
              "path": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1414235077428-338989a2e8c0?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1600&q=80",
              "alt": "Warm dining room of the first Root & Grain kitchen with wooden tables",
              "width": 1600,
              "height": 2000
            },
            "secondaryMedia": {
              "kind": "image",
              "path": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1552566626-52f8b828add9?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=80",
              "alt": "Open kitchen where cooks assemble salads and grain bowls to order",
              "width": 1200,
              "height": 1200
            },
            "stats": [
              { "id": "farms", "value": "38", "label": "Family farm partners" },
              { "id": "scratch", "value": "100%", "label": "Cooked from scratch" },
              { "id": "stores", "value": "3", "label": "Kitchens in three states" }
            ],
            "action": { "label": "Explore the Menu", "target": { "kind": "page", "pageId": "menu" } }
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "reviews",
          "type": "testimonials",
          "variant": "guests",
          "content": {
            "eyebrow": "Guest reviews",
            "title": "What people say after lunch",
            "description": "Ratings from guests who ordered pickup or delivery in the last 90 days.",
            "reviews": [
              {
                "id": "maya-r",
                "quote": "The greens actually taste like something. I order the Guacamole Greens twice a week and it is still the best salad within walking distance of my office.",
                "name": "Maya R.",
                "detail": "Santa Monica, CA",
                "favorite": "Usually orders: Guacamole Greens",
                "rating": 5,
                "media": {
                  "kind": "image",
                  "path": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1494790108377-be9c29b29330?auto=format&fit=crop&w=400&q=80",
                  "alt": "Portrait of Maya R., a regular guest",
                  "width": 400,
                  "height": 400
                }
              },
              {
                "id": "daniel-o",
                "quote": "Pickup in six minutes, no seed oils, and the farro is warm when I get back to my desk. It replaced the sandwich shop I used for years.",
                "name": "Daniel O.",
                "detail": "Austin, TX",
                "favorite": "Usually orders: Warm Farro & Mushroom",
                "rating": 5,
                "media": {
                  "kind": "image",
                  "path": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1507003211169-0a1dd7228f2d?auto=format&fit=crop&w=400&q=80",
                  "alt": "Portrait of Daniel O., a regular guest",
                  "width": 400,
                  "height": 400
                }
              },
              {
                "id": "priya-n",
                "quote": "As someone who eats gluten free, I can build a bowl without losing any flavour. The staff knows the menu and swaps without making it a thing.",
                "name": "Priya N.",
                "detail": "Brooklyn, NY",
                "favorite": "Usually orders: Sesame Salmon Bowl",
                "rating": 5,
                "media": {
                  "kind": "image",
                  "path": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1438761681033-6461ffad8d80?auto=format&fit=crop&w=400&q=80",
                  "alt": "Portrait of Priya N., a regular guest",
                  "width": 400,
                  "height": 400
                }
              },
              {
                "id": "carlos-m",
                "quote": "We order the catering trays for team lunches. Twenty people fed, everything labelled, nothing left over and no complaints about salad for once.",
                "name": "Carlos M.",
                "detail": "South Congress, TX",
                "favorite": "Usually orders: Catering trays for 20",
                "rating": 5,
                "media": {
                  "kind": "image",
                  "path": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1500648767791-00dcc994a43e?auto=format&fit=crop&w=400&q=80",
                  "alt": "Portrait of Carlos M., a catering guest",
                  "width": 400,
                  "height": 400
                }
              },
              {
                "id": "noor-a",
                "quote": "You can see the whole prep line, so nothing is a mystery. I built a bowl around the chicken pesto quinoa and it has been my Tuesday lunch ever since.",
                "name": "Noor A.",
                "detail": "Williamsburg, NY",
                "favorite": "Usually orders: Chicken Pesto Quinoa",
                "rating": 5,
                "media": {
                  "kind": "image",
                  "path": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1534528741775-53994a69daeb?auto=format&fit=crop&w=400&q=80",
                  "alt": "Portrait of Noor A., a regular guest",
                  "width": 400,
                  "height": 400
                }
              },
              {
                "id": "tomas-b",
                "quote": "Four stars only because I wish the South Congress kitchen opened before eleven. The shrimp caesar itself is consistent every single time, and the greens never arrive wilted.",
                "name": "Tomás B.",
                "detail": "South Congress, TX",
                "favorite": "Usually orders: Spicy Shrimp Caesar",
                "rating": 4,
                "media": {
                  "kind": "image",
                  "path": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1506794778202-cad84cf45f1d?auto=format&fit=crop&w=400&q=80",
                  "alt": "Portrait of Tomás B., a regular guest",
                  "width": 400,
                  "height": 400
                }
              },
              {
                "id": "elaine-k",
                "quote": "Ordering ahead for delivery is the part I did not expect to love. Dressing comes on the side, the cobb is cold when it should be, and it still looks like the photo.",
                "name": "Elaine K.",
                "detail": "Santa Monica, CA",
                "favorite": "Usually orders: Harvest Cobb",
                "rating": 5,
                "media": {
                  "kind": "image",
                  "path": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1544005313-94ddf0286df2?auto=format&fit=crop&w=400&q=80",
                  "alt": "Portrait of Elaine K., a regular guest",
                  "width": 400,
                  "height": 400
                }
              },
              {
                "id": "jordan-p",
                "quote": "Weeknight dinner for four that everyone eats without negotiation. The sweet potato bowl keeps the kids happy and I am not cooking two meals.",
                "name": "Jordan P.",
                "detail": "Brooklyn, NY",
                "favorite": "Usually orders: Miso Sweet Potato Bowl",
                "rating": 5,
                "media": {
                  "kind": "image",
                  "path": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1524504388940-b1c1722653e1?auto=format&fit=crop&w=400&q=80",
                  "alt": "Portrait of Jordan P., a regular guest",
                  "width": 400,
                  "height": 400
                }
              }
            ]
          }
